# Build context for the orchestrator image: apps/.
# Whitelist: only the orchestrator project and its llm-stub sibling (path source in
# [tool.uv.sources]) are needed. The other apps, caches and local venvs are excluded.
*
!orchestrator
!orchestrator/pyproject.toml
!orchestrator/uv.lock
!orchestrator/src
!orchestrator/src/**
!orchestrator/prompts
!orchestrator/prompts/**
!llm-stub
!llm-stub/pyproject.toml
!llm-stub/src
!llm-stub/src/**
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
